{
  "id": "treasury_stock",
  "name": "宝库收纳",
  "description": "每次施放为自己的宝库增加层数并刷新闲置计时，上限10层。amount 为每次增加层数，cap 为层数上限，duration 为停手后的等待时间（基础5秒），decay_interval 为开始衰减后每消失一层的间隔（基础2秒）；任意层数停手第5秒减第一层，随后每2秒减一层。rate 为每秒基础期望系数（基础1），实际基础出射期望为 rate ×（当前层数+1）枚/秒，即1层约2枚/秒、10层约11枚/秒；采用种子化泊松到达，逐枚在随机时刻发射，不固定周期齐射，不承诺每一秒恰好固定数量。range 为随机索敌半径（米），cooldown 为主动冷却（秒）。每枚独立随机索敌；再次施放只加层和刷新闲置计时，保留未用完的随机等待量。自动出射不额外施法、支付资源或刷新闲置计时；层数归零停止。 独立自叠层特性通过 treasury_feed 事件为已经启动的宝库补层，实际补层刷新闲置计时；没有这些特性时自动出射本身不补层。",
  "params": {
    "amount": 1,
    "cap": 10,
    "duration": 5,
    "decay_interval": 2,
    "range": 24,
    "cooldown": 0.65,
    "rate": 1
  },
  "sheet": [{ "grant_skill": "treasury_enuma_elish" }],
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "treasury_collect",
      "event": "cast",
      "conditions": [{ "op": "active", "key": "treasury_stock" }],
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "maintain_emitter",
          "key": "weapons",
          "channel": "royal_treasury",
          "scope": "owner",
          "event": "treasury_volley",
          "targeting": "random",
          "value": {
            "param": "amount"
          },
          "cap": {
            "param": "cap"
          },
          "duration": {
            "param": "duration"
          },
          "decay_interval": {
            "param": "decay_interval"
          },
          "radius": {
            "param": "range"
          },
          "rate": {
            "mul": [
              {
                "param": "rate"
              },
              {
                "add": [
                  1,
                  {
                    "event": "amount"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "treasury_feed",
      "event": "treasury_feed",
      "actions": [
        {
          "op": "maintain_emitter",
          "mode": "feed",
          "key": "weapons",
          "channel": "royal_treasury",
          "scope": "owner",
          "value": {
            "event": "amount"
          }
        }
      ],
      "chain": {
        "maxDepth": 8
      },
      "conditions": [
        {
          "op": "state",
          "key": "weapons",
          "channel": "royal_treasury",
          "scope": "owner",
          "compare": "gte",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
